@title A job that did not work is a triangle on the top bar with Dismiss (1920x1080)
@area Shell
@sizes 1920x1080
@env PATH=/nonexistent
# T14: Help > Open log folder cannot start a file manager (PATH is empty): the toast becomes a yellow red/yellow triangle next to the Issues pill.
click_text "New project"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text open log folder
wait 6
key Enter
wait 10
expect "Log folder did not open"
shot chip
check_layout
click_text "Log folder did not open" Button
wait 6
expect "Log folder did not open"
expect "Dismiss"
shot popover
check_layout
click_text "Dismiss" Button
wait 6
expect_not "Log folder did not open"
shot dismissed
